# VAME Workflows

This module will host lab-standard workflows for using VAME with DeepLabCut-derived pose data.

## Current Status

Documentation and analysis assets are in active development. This section is maintained as a stable entry point for future reproducible VAME workflows used in the lab.

## Planned Documentation Scope

- Environment setup and dependency versions
- Input data schema (expected DLC/VAME file structures)
- Standardized preprocessing and model configuration
- Post-model analysis templates and export formats

## Interim Guidance

- Use configurable project paths (no absolute local-machine paths).
- Track package versions and model parameters alongside outputs.
- Store derived outputs in structured tabular formats for downstream statistical analysis.
